marigold_empty_prompt.safetensors
---------------------------------

The embedding the Marigold intrinsic decomposition checkpoints condition on: the two token
empty prompt, read once out of the CLIP text encoder published inside
https://huggingface.co/prs-eth/marigold-iid-appearance-v1-1 and
https://huggingface.co/prs-eth/marigold-iid-lighting-v1-1, which produce it identically. The
file holds one 1 x 2 x 1024 single precision tensor.

Those repositories release their weights under the Open RAIL++-M license, copyright
2023-2025 PRS, ETH Zürich, which is at
https://huggingface.co/prs-eth/marigold-iid-appearance-v1-1/blob/main/LICENSE-MODEL.txt and
states that the licensor claims no rights in output generated with the model. Its use
restrictions still reach any use of that output.
